   "no": 3,
   "en": "DATA",
   "title": "你需要准备什么",
   "html": "<p>本地演示无需接入现场。下面的数据清单用于说明这一业务的资料要求，不表示项目已取得这些实测资料。</p><p>数据来自现有 SCADA 系统，门槛低、量大；真正稀缺的是<b>故障标签</b>——它藏在历次检泵作业的起泵核实结论里，要按标准词表逐条整理。井况数据（气油比、含水）用来区分「泵的问题」和「井的问题」，避免把供液不足错怪到泵头上。</p><div class='checklist'><div class='cl-head'><span>数据准备清单 · 3 项</span><span class='cl-prog'><span id='cl-txt'>0 / 3</span><span class='cl-bar'><i id='cl-fill'></i></span></span></div><div class='cl-item' data-cl='0'><span class='cl-box'><svg width='10' height='10' viewBox='0 0 24 24' fill='none' stroke='#fff' stroke-width='4' stroke-linecap='round' stroke-linejoin='round'><path d='M4 12.5l5 5L20 6.5'/></svg></span><span><span class='cl-t'>电泵运行参数</span><span class='cl-s'>电流、电压、频率、井口压力</span></span><span class='cl-n'>分钟级，单井 10 万点，无需标注</span></div><div class='cl-item' data-cl='1'><span class='cl-box'><svg width='10' height='10' viewBox='0 0 24 24' fill='none' stroke='#fff' stroke-width='4' stroke-linecap='round' stroke-linejoin='round'><path d='M4 12.5l5 5L20 6.5'/></svg></span><span><span class='cl-t'>故障与检泵记录</span><span class='cl-s'>故障类型、发生时间、起泵核实结论</span></span><span class='cl-n'>单区块数百起，作为标签与阈值校准</span></div><div class='cl-item' data-cl='2'><span class='cl-box'><svg width='10' height='10' viewBox='0 0 24 24' fill='none' stroke='#fff' stroke-width='4' stroke-linecap='round' stroke-linejoin='round'><path d='M4 12.5l5 5L20 6.5'/></svg></span><span><span class='cl-t'>井况数据</span><span class='cl-s'>含水、气油比、温度、砂浓度</span></span><span class='cl-n'>辅助判断，区分泵因与井因</span></div></div>"
